[{"title":"得徐闇公信，以「交行诗刻」见寄二首 其二","author":"张煌言","text":"瘴海谁堪汗漫行，知君五月在舟程。\n鳀人鼓鬣惊涛暗，乌鬼含沙宿雾生。\n温峤已乖归阙望，张骞徒负泛槎名！\n武陵溪畔桃源客，故节依然苏子卿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27180,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"会师东瓯漫成","author":"张煌言","text":"瓯越江声动鼓鼙，霸图南北似鸡栖；谁为揖客称司马，独将游兵是水犀。\n箸借自来非为汉，瑟操犹恐未工齐。\n十年种、蠡成何事，敢向人前说会稽！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27181,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上闻笛","author":"张煌言","text":"江涛日夜堆云屋，有酒难向江濑漉。\n忽闻笛韵横江来，金山数峰爱青簇。\n笛声不似水声幽，声惨潮生响飞瀑；月痕淡洗天为空，一曲潇湘醒倦目。\n亦有羁人青雀舫，稳载客愁二千斛；起舞鸲鹆江影底，四顾茫苍复恸哭。\n独汲江心水一盂，活火烹来涤烦燠；余情袅袅笛转清，拍手长吟和孤竹。\n歌者有意吹无心，嘈然那分竹与肉。\n嗟嗟江上听笛人，独抱琵琶就人宿。\n知音若我世所稀，邻舟逋客眠初熟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27182,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"师次观音门","author":"张煌言","text":"楼船十万石头城，钟阜依然拱旧京。\n弓剑秋藏云五色，旌旗夜度月三更。\n中原父老还扶杖，绝塞河山自寝兵。\n不信封侯皆上将，前茅独让弃繻生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27183,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"师次芜湖，时余所遣前军已受降","author":"张煌言","text":"元戎小队压江关，面缚长鲸敢逆颜。\n吴楚衣冠左衽后，萧梁城郭暮笳间。\n王师未必皆无战，胡马相传已不还。\n寄语壶浆休怨望，悬军端欲慰民艰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27184,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"师入太平府","author":"张煌言","text":"天骄取次奉冠裳，畿辅长驱铁裲裆。\n王业昔谁开采石，霸图古亦起丹阳。\n百年礼乐还丰、镐，一路云霓载酒浆。\n此去神京原咫尺，龙蟠虎踞待重光！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27185,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"姑孰既下，和州、无为州及高淳、溧水、溧阳、建平、庐江、舒城、含山、巢县诸邑相继来归","author":"张煌言","text":"干将一试已芒寒，赤县神州次第安；建业山川吴帝阙，皖城戈甲魏军坛。\n东来玉帛空胡虏，北望铜符尽汉官。\n犹忆高皇初定鼎，和阳草昧正艰难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27186,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"驿书至，偏师已复池州府","author":"张煌言","text":"赤羽飞驰露布哗，铜陵西去断胡笳。\n横流锦缆空三楚，出峡霓旌接九华。\n歌吹已知来泽国，樵苏莫遣向田家！\n前驱要识王师意，剑跃弓鸣亦漫誇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27187,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"师入宁国，时徽郡来降，留都尚未克复","author":"张煌言","text":"千骑东方出上游，天声今喜到宣州。\n威仪此日惊司隶，勋业何人愧彻侯！\n旧阙烽烟须早靖，新都版籍已全收。\n遗民莫道来苏好，讲恐疮痍未可瘳！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27188,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"间行杂感二首 其一","author":"张煌言","text":"铁幢才解又芒鞋，姓氏逢人且自埋。\n夜踏巉岩惊伏虎，朝披雾露避群豺。\n乾坤苍莽投金濑，径路萧凉阻玉阶。\n赢得风衣兼雨帽，相看不是旧形骸！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27189,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"间行杂感二首 其二","author":"张煌言","text":"一椎可奈误秦车，萧瑟秋风圯上书。\n伏匿那能忘铁马，潜游犹觉负银鱼。\n荒村云扰难攲枕，单袷霜深已敝裾。\n总是姓名随地变，任呼牛马亦何如！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27190,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经乌江二首 其一","author":"张煌言","text":"楚歌声里霸图空，匹马归来势自雄；四百年余炎火断，谁知隆准一重瞳！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27191,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经乌江二首 其二","author":"张煌言","text":"旌旗垓下亦堪翻，战士其如忆故园；纵向江东收烬去，应无子弟到中原。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27192,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枞阳谣二首 其一","author":"张煌言","text":"八尺风帆百丈牵，枞阳湖里去如烟；江南米价秋来长，喜杀桐艚卖稻船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27193,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枞阳谣二首 其二","author":"张煌言","text":"沿湖下网荡湖船，网内纤鳞锦样鲜；灯火湖边儿女笑，鱼秧种得不须田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27194,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄湓谣二首 其一","author":"张煌言","text":"妾家生小住黄湓，乱挽乌云铲著裈；九月鱼腥湖上熟，自摇兰桨过前村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27195,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄湓谣二首 其二","author":"张煌言","text":"黄湓贾客百金装，湓口长年醉索郎；闻说江干烽火急，停桡一曲「古襄阳。\n」","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27196,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新安溪行","author":"张煌言","text":"曲曲溪流面面山，青峰千折水千湾；山亭拥雾遥疑塔，水碓舂云巧作关。\n越榜下滩双桨疾，吴盐到界一帆閒。\n却看两岸枫林晚，似送离愁照客颜！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27197,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄宿石塘庵，与居人道定西侯往事","author":"张煌言","text":"汉腊谁留十五年，琴亡岛屿尚苍然；野人偏爱甘棠树，义士犹吟「华屋篇。\n」海有浮鸥怜后死，村无眠犊忆前贤。\n请看缑岭今宵月，可得将军勒马还！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27198,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生还四首 其一","author":"张煌言","text":"落魄须眉在，招魂部曲稀。\n生还非众望，死战有谁归！\n蹈险身谋拙，包羞心事违。\n江东父老见，一一问重围。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27199,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生还四首 其二","author":"张煌言","text":"痛定悲畴昔，江皋望阵云。\n飞熊先失律，骑虎竟孤军。\n卤莽焚舟计，虺隤汗马勋。\n至今频扼腕，野哭不堪闻！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27200,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生还四首 其三","author":"张煌言","text":"本以扬旌去，胡为弃甲旋！\n名城空绣错，故老尽株连。\n百折终何补，千秋倘复怜！\n亦知收烬易，萧索愧金钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27201,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"生还四首 其四","author":"张煌言","text":"奔北谁能殿，图南我亦迷；翻令百步笑，未得一枝栖。\n孤岛摇烽燧，登坛恃鼓鼙。\n风云蹉跌后，无计展霜蹄！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27202,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海滨居民闻予生还，咸为手额；且以壶浆相饷。余自惭无似，何以得此于舆情也","author":"张煌言","text":"虚名浪说逐群雄，垂翅何心得楚弓。\n每把金鱼羞父老，岂应竹马笑儿童！\n衣冠不改秦时俗，鸡黍相遗晋代风。\n正觉渔樵多厚道，不将白眼看途穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27203,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仆还","author":"张煌言","text":"仆贞良不易，旅琐更为难。\n已任辞鞲去，还同恋栈看。\n敝帷原有待，堕履未应拚；自是无银鹿，犹胜形影单。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27204,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜，同陈文生过黄粹伯留酌","author":"张煌言","text":"为妒秋容爱晚行，明河如练月初更。\n当关忽报双筇过，入座先惊一榻横。\n此夜冰壶堪濯魄，谁家纨扇独关情！\n风流笑杀黄山谷，厨传居然阮步兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27205,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠陈文生侍御返命闽峤 其一","author":"张煌言","text":"益部今何似，孤悬一使星。\n满思匡汉室，虚拟乞秦庭。\n鹤立孤臣泪，龙潜旧主灵。\n倡予还和汝，天梦倘然醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27206,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠陈文生侍御返命闽峤 其二","author":"张煌言","text":"恨别还如昔，忧危较独多。\n孤槎偏局蹐，故节已蹉跎。\n羽翼犹吾否？\n须眉奈尔何！\n南阳雄虽在，努力向滹沱！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27207,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦饥","author":"张煌言","text":"登彼三神山，慨焉思遐举。\n芦荻风萧萧，白石不可煮。\n绝粒固所宜，踌躇伤徒侣。\n骧首视乌鸢，青天嚇腐鼠。\n不念山中人，瓶罄亦罍耻，岂乏稻粱谋，卑栖因铩羽。\n安得有蕨薇，疗饥待明主！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27208,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庖焚","author":"张煌言","text":"已自伤余烬，何劳厨传灾！\n早应防厝火，空复冀燃灰。\n鼎俎浑轻掷，盘盂且尽隤。\n明朝添菜色，那得爨烟开！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27209,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"萍踪同邱含山感赋","author":"张煌言","text":"萧瑟干戈事，浮踪已似萍。\n半床留破席，一室欠疏棂。\n霜月窥人白，渔灯入夜青。\n天涯知己在，犹自叹零丁！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27210,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送邱含山还长亭山房","author":"张煌言","text":"投老犹垂橐，忘归未拂衣。\n江山双泪迸，家国寸心违。\n作客悲王粲，为郎忆紫薇。\n入林还怅望，吾道已全非！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27211,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得姚兴公书，以「舫音集」见寄 其一","author":"张煌言","text":"何处纤鳞至，琼云落满函？\n虎溪闻卓锡，鹭岛忆归帆。\n诗律随人老，禅锋已不凡；惭予尘梦在，兀兀趁征衫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27212,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得姚兴公书，以「舫音集」见寄 其二","author":"张煌言","text":"救世嗟无具，为僧亦自嘉。\n只愁新旧雨，总属暮朝霞。\n枫落江烟淡，梅横溪月斜。\n何时双舄下，相对饭胡麻！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27213,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卜居","author":"张煌言","text":"荒洲小筑笑焚余，结构新茆再卜居。\n性僻故贪鸥鹭侣，地偏犹偪虎狼墟。\n寒芦瑟瑟秋张乐，宿火荧荧夜读书。\n正忆普天方左衽，此身那得混樵渔！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27214,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪行二首 其一","author":"张煌言","text":"扶筇到处见山晴，峰色溪光次第迎；满径莓苔人语静，画眉宛转两三声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27215,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪行二首 其二","author":"张煌言","text":"小立寒林意独醒，清泉石窦自泠泠；拨云更望前溪去，树底飞来一片青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27216,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岛居八首 其一","author":"张煌言","text":"天地劳何甚，空山足息机；玄黄悲鼎沸，苍莽看帆飞。\n误世芙蓉剑，撩人薜荔衣；迷途知未远，还复卧凫矶？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27217,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岛居八首 其二","author":"张煌言","text":"岛事几沧桑，何劳更辨亡！\n人能扶日毂，我且挟云囊。\n傲骨甘鸥鹭，雄心怯虎狼。\n诛茅还辟土，海外有封疆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27218,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岛居八首 其三","author":"张煌言","text":"古贤多大隐，岂必尽攀龙！\n所惜辜三辅，其如碍两雄。\n计疏凭铸错，道废漫书空！\n仰止羊裘客，千秋一冥鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27219,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岛居八首 其四","author":"张煌言","text":"山中仍逐鹿，却喜小雄雌。\n蜑户供新错，蜃楼献秘嬉。\n凿坏聊偃蹇，拜石故支离。\n试问门前雀，何如翟尉时？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27220,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岛居八首 其五","author":"张煌言","text":"阊阖不可极，投荒「小有天。\n」行藏疑橘叟，变化愧梅仙。\n野火渔镫外，樵风雁字前。\n到来生百感，太息理诗篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27221,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岛居八首 其六","author":"张煌言","text":"浮槎非我好，恋恋为衣冠。\n豫让桥应近，田横岛正宽。\n芦中长磬折，圯上独盘桓。\n虽未成嘉遁，人呼管幼安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27222,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岛居八首 其七","author":"张煌言","text":"十洲曾卜筑，师过化为薪；荆棘任公宅，蓬蒿夸父津。\n老麖避客去，旧犬逐人亲。\n不忍乖初服，茅檐又日新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27223,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岛居八首 其八","author":"张煌言","text":"鸠工严部勒，治屋亦犹兵；据水轩辕法，依山壁垒横。\n短垣缭却月，中溜贯长庚。\n只此扶桑国，居然细柳营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27224,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"索居岛上，童子折梅来献，喜而有赋；限「十三元」二首 其一","author":"张煌言","text":"芳信天涯谁过存，一枝瞥见慰离魂。\n寄来庾岭应无驿，疑到罗浮别有村。\n仙史轻华宜淡墨，故人萧散足清尊。\n巡檐为弄阳春曲，羌笛何须恼故园！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27225,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"索居岛上，童子折梅来献，喜而有赋；限「十三元」二首 其二","author":"张煌言","text":"绝岛凝寒气未温，忽传春信到蓬门。\n苍寒犹带烟霞韵，素魄时留冰雪痕。\n欲探陇头愁远树，却看墙角喜孤根。\n疏枝冷蕊仍堪把，何逊扬州且莫论！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27226,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得「相逢俱是岁寒人」","author":"张煌言","text":"相逢俱是岁寒人，迟暮偏惊摇落辰。\n鸿雁接天关塞影，渔樵满地雪霜身。\n论交四海惭兄弟，抗迹千秋泣鬼神。\n此日炎趋应不少，道旁裘马正纷纶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27227,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春用杜韵","author":"张煌言","text":"腊残海峤悬桃日，正是山家爆竹时。\n寂寞两京寒玉琯，萧疏双鬓点银丝。\n干戈回首成都梦，杖履随身那免悲！\n不饮也应春酒笑，强邀石冻助新诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27228,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"己亥除夕","author":"张煌言","text":"湖海椒觞十五星，故园咫尺却扬舲。\n流年与日相将去，归梦兼愁总未醒。\n腊鼓何如鼙鼓急，闽船犹并越船停。\n春来消息茫无据，起把菱花仔细听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27229,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚子元旦驻师林门","author":"张煌言","text":"中华正朔古相传，永历于今十四年。\n玉几南荒新日月，金戈北道旧山川。\n春来水逐桃花长，老去人憎柏叶先。\n犹幸此身仍健在，拟随斗柄独回天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27230,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚子新正二日，坐雨岛上","author":"张煌言","text":"才望晴云布岁朝，渐来仙峤雨潇潇。\n山烟缭绕苍堪滴，海气模糊白欲飘。\n拨闷屠苏随意醉，滞寒榾柮逐时烧。\n故人天际谁相问，总为春风尚寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27231,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游小岙草庵","author":"张煌言","text":"春郊弥望尽苍烟，选胜还探「小有天。\n」笋乱新篁饶玉版，花迷野菜似金钿。\n客来渐与山麋狎，僧去惟留海鹤眠。\n堪笑阮生几两屐，桃源总在万峰前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27232,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得朱子成书","author":"张煌言","text":"书来惜分手，正忆皖城秋。\n入海仍精卫，还山尚蒯缑；参差非恨事，仓卒少良谋。\n异日传「心史，」孤忠冀见收！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27233,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒山","author":"张煌言","text":"寒山一息影，岐路总忘机。\n敢望充藜藿，其如断蕨薇！\n徘徊贪有发，惆怅赋无衣。\n此地兼烽火，孤踪何所依！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27234,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻监国鲁王以盗警奔金门所","author":"张煌言","text":"挥泪东南信，初闻群盗狂；扁舟哀望帝，匹马类康王。\n流彘终何限，依斟倘不妨！\n只今谋税驾，天地已沧桑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27235,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张书绅还钱塘","author":"张煌言","text":"归棹萧然入虎林，论兵十载怆知音！\n千金散尽仍弹铗，四海交空且碎琴。\n户牖阴谋天地忌，夷门奇计古今深。\n风尘何处躬耕好，垂老还为梁父吟！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27236,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上巳书怀","author":"张煌言","text":"九月春光强半空，今朝禊事媚东风。\n乱红过雨应千点，新绿含烟自一丛。\n曲水无觞娱岛上，远山似笏拱帘中。\n子规岁岁啼成血，不道劳人太转蓬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27237,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晚","author":"张煌言","text":"芳洲春晚遍蘼芜，一抹烟光挂绿图。\n好鸟弄晴声剧腻，野花吹暖气流苏。\n中年豪举还多少，来日往游定有无！\n可惜艳阳閒谢却，祇应吾道在江湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27238,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过桃渚","author":"张煌言","text":"一棹天台依旧迷，重来秋爽足攀跻；苔衣糁糁髯偏美，石磴鳞鳞齿未齐。\n梦到赤城霞气近，感深沧海水声低。\n临流空作桃花想，愧杀仙源是武溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27239,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复屯林门","author":"张煌言","text":"十年兵甲满沧洲，此日回戈又上游。\n人去鹿场仍旧迹，秋高蟹脯足晨羞。\n空山饿犬声如豹，失路穷黎状似鸠。\n自笑经营何太拙，误将岛屿作并州！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27240,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋有怀","author":"张煌言","text":"去年拾桂英山里，今夕浮槎涨海东；关塞每怜鸿雁影，江湖应怅鲤鱼风。\n金飙玉露原无异，跃马乘舟已不同。\n明月当前人在侧，持螯把盏莫辞从！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27241,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步韵和曹云霖「浯岛秋怀」二首 其一","author":"张煌言","text":"荒烟残烧越王台，忆昔雄图今倍哀。\n丹叶三秋何事老，翠华六诏几时回？\n才从鹭岛怀人远，忽得鱼书对客开。\n诗律迩来知渐细，高吟低唱且徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27242,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"步韵和曹云霖「浯岛秋怀」二首 其二","author":"张煌言","text":"天长地阔总伤秋，闽峤寒云路更悠。\n戴汉节旄空自脱，沼吴薪胆向谁谋！\n百年形胜留天堑，一望风烟达帝沟。\n堪笑鱼龙还寂寂，祗应陵树锁江流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27243,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜舟中听雨","author":"张煌言","text":"不尽萧萧意，还从子夜生；草枯沙碛气，木落洞庭声。\n攲枕闻疏密，敲篷辨浊清。\n浑疑刁斗静，铁骑暗纵横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27244,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新河口雨泊二首 其一","author":"张煌言","text":"一水真衣带，金行报几签。\n回飙何震荡，飞沫更廉纤。\n啮岸潮声壮，胶舟风势严。\n丛祠堪蔽雨，分旅向山尖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":27245,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]